==================== Input ====================
/* A signed item past the first position prints like an unsigned one (DIVERGENCES.md#signed-value-resplit):
   it does not break the list, and it does not glue to the word before it. */
a {
  font-family: Arial, -apple-system;
  font-family: -apple-system, Arial;
  -webkit-mask-position-x: 50px, 25%, -3em;
  -webkit-mask-position-x: 50px, 25%, 3em;
  background: url("/shared-assets/images/examples/web-animations/cat_sprite.png") -600px 0 no-repeat;
}

